				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;event-system&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Event System&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#event-system&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Event system is a way to comunicate between systems in Game.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;According to &lt;a href=&#34;https://gameprogrammingpatterns.com/event-queue.html&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Game Programming Pattern (Event Queue)&lt;/a&gt; there is two types of events.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Notifcations Event.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Request Event.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;notifcations-event&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Notifcations Event.&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#notifcations-event&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Which is just notify the systems that some event did happen for example:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ATTENTION SYSTEMS!! &lt;br&gt;&#xA;An Enemy Just Died&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description>
